  "notes": "Used for formal membership in organizations, clubs, gyms, associations, etc. Not used for casual groups or informal gatherings.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {入会|にゅうかい}{金|きん} (enrollment fee, joining fee)\n- {入会|にゅうかい}{手続|てつづ}き (membership procedures)\n- {入会|にゅうかい}{申|もう}し{込|こ}み (membership application)\n- {入会|にゅうかい}{資格|しかく} (membership eligibility)\n- {入会|にゅうかい}を{申|もう}し{込|こ}む (apply for membership)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {退会|たいかい}: withdrawing from membership, leaving an organization",
